@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Microwave Oven

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry / Display current time
Idle : do / Wait for user input

Idle --> WaitingForInput : [User selects power level]

state "Waiting for input" as WaitingForInput
WaitingForInput : entry / Get power level selection
WaitingForInput : do / Validate power level selection
WaitingForInput : exit / Set cooking time or cancel

WaitingForInput --> CookingTimeEntry : [Valid power level selection]
CookingTimeEntry --> CookingProcess : [User enters cooking time]

state "Cooking process" as CookingProcess
CookingProcess : entry / Start cooking timer
CookingProcess : do / Monitor door status
CookingProcess : exit / Stop or cancel cooking

CookingProcess --> Stopped : [Door opened during cooking]
Stopped --> Idle : [Stop cooking immediately]

CookingProcess --> Cancelled : [User cancels cooking process]
Cancelled --> Idle : [Return to idle state]

state "Stopped" as Stopped
Stopped : entry / Display current time
Stopped : do / Wait for next use

Idle --> WaitingForInput : [User selects power level]

@enduml
